MID_Roster_Dislike_Cle_001: 
MID_Roster_Dislike_Mys_001: 
MID_Roster_Dislike_Kra_001: Les personnes irrationnelles,\nle luxe, les vantards.
MID_Roster_Dislike_Kou_001: Dagda le Grand, les divinités,\nelle-même.
MID_Roster_Dislike_Kou_002: Elle-même.
MID_Roster_Dislike_Tro_001: Dagda le Grand, les temples, Vritra.
