MID_Roster_Dislike_Sol_001: Le manque d'ambition, les gens\nmalveillants.
MID_Roster_Dislike_Mar_001: Les personnes rusées, la lâcheté.
MID_Roster_Dislike_Smi_001: 
MID_Roster_Dislike_Cla_001: 
MID_Roster_Dislike_Car_001: 
MID_Roster_Dislike_Cas_001: La négligence, vieillir.
MID_Roster_Dislike_Cen_001: Les gens qui ne respectent pas\nles règles, les criminels.
MID_Roster_Dislike_Tah_001: Les cancrelaids, l'alcool.
MID_Roster_Dislike_Nom_001: 
MID_Roster_Dislike_Lon_001: Les sucreries, le manque\nd'attention.
MID_Roster_Dislike_Sua_001: 
MID_Roster_Dislike_Cir_001: 
MID_Roster_Dislike_Che_001: 
MID_Roster_Dislike_Kir_001: Les gens malpolis ou qui s'opposent\nà lui, les riches, les fantômes.
MID_Roster_Dislike_Ann_001: Les souris, le mensonge.
MID_Roster_Dislike_Mra_001: Les personnes qui ont mauvais\ncaractère.
